      "notes": "Single corridor, 21 stations (14 elevated, 7 at-grade), 35 articulated buses, 12.5 km elevated. 'Red Line' label comes from PMA's Integrated Public Transport Network Multan plan (which also proposes unbuilt Orange/Purple/Blue MBS lines); buses are not route-coded. Station names per PMA/Wikipedia; safar spells Bahadarpur, Nothern Bypass, Qasim Fort, Dolat Gate, Ahmedabad. OSM tags Hafiz Jamal station as 'Shah Jamal Metrobus' and Fort Qasim as 'Qasim Bagh Metrobus' (matched by sequence). Feeder transfers per safar: Mehmood Kot-MFR39; Fort Qasim-MFR02/03/03B; BCG Chowk & Peoples Colony-MFR11/08B; Vehari Chowk-MFR11/08B/04/07B; Kumharanwala-MFR03B. Hours and frequency from the official timetable for 2026-10-23 (first and last departure, typical gap between buses)."
